<blocks app="Snap! 12, https://snap.berkeley.edu" version="2"><palette><category name="Modular" color="120,60,160,1"/></palette><block-definition s="load modular synth primitives" type="command" category="Modular" helper="true"><header></header><code></code><translations></translations><inputs></inputs><script><block s="doApplyExtension"><l>src_load(url)</l><list><l>libraries/modular/modular.js</l></list></block></script></block-definition><block-definition s="create %&apos;type&apos; module named %&apos;name&apos;" type="command" category="Modular"><comment x="0" y="0" w="260" collapsed="false">Creates a new synthesizer module and gives it a name. The name is used by all other blocks to refer to this module. Creating a module with a name that already exists replaces the old module.&#xD;&#xD;VCO: oscillator (A-110). Inputs: cv1 (1 V per octave), cv2, pw cv, sync. Outputs: saw, square, triangle, sine. Knobs: range (octaves), tune (semitones), pulse width (0-1), cv2 level, pw cv level.&#xD;&#xD;VCF: 24 dB low pass filter (A-120). Inputs: audio, cv1 (1 V per octave), cv2, cv3. Output: lowpass. Knobs: frequency (Hz), resonance (0-1), audio level, cv2 level, cv3 level.&#xD;&#xD;VCA: linear amplifier (A-130). Inputs: audio 1, audio 2, cv1, cv2. Output: out. Knobs: gain (0-1), audio 1 level, audio 2 level, cv2 level. A control voltage of +5 V gives unity gain.&#xD;&#xD;ADSR: envelope generator (A-140). Inputs: gate, retrigger. Outputs: envelope (0 to +8 V), inverted. Knobs: attack, decay, release (seconds), sustain (0-1).&#xD;&#xD;LFO: low frequency oscillator (A-145). Input: reset (restarts the cycle). Outputs: sine, triangle, saw, square (-5 to +5 V). Knob: frequency (Hz). Patch an output into a cv2 input and turn up that module&apos;s cv2 level knob to modulate it.&#xD;&#xD;A module named &quot;speaker&quot; always exists. Patch into its &quot;in&quot; jack to hear a signal. Its only knob is volume (0-1).</comment><header></header><code></code><translations></translations><inputs><input type="%s" readonly="true">VCO<options>VCO&#xD;VCF&#xD;VCA&#xD;ADSR&#xD;LFO</options></input><input type="%s">osc1</input></inputs><script><custom-block s="load modular synth primitives"></custom-block><block s="doApplyExtension"><l>syn_create(type, name)</l><list><block var="type"/><block var="name"/></list></block></script></block-definition><block-definition s="delete module %&apos;name&apos;" type="command" category="Modular"><comment x="0" y="0" w="200" collapsed="false">Removes a module and all cables plugged into it.</comment><header></header><code></code><translations></translations><inputs><input type="%s"><options>§_ext_syn_names</options></input></inputs><script><custom-block s="load modular synth primitives"></custom-block><block s="doApplyExtension"><l>syn_delete(name)</l><list><block var="name"/></list></block></script></block-definition><block-definition s="delete all modules" type="command" category="Modular"><comment x="0" y="0" w="200" collapsed="false">Removes every module except the speaker, and silences the synth.</comment><header></header><code></code><translations></translations><inputs></inputs><script><custom-block s="load modular synth primitives"></custom-block><block s="doApplyExtension"><l>syn_clear()</l><list></list></block></script></block-definition><block-definition s="connect %&apos;module&apos; %&apos;output&apos; to %&apos;module2&apos; %&apos;input&apos;" type="command" category="Modular"><comment x="0" y="0" w="260" collapsed="false">Plugs a patch cable from an output jack of one module into an input jack of another. Several cables may share one input; their signals are added. Signals and control voltages flow at audio rate inside the browser&apos;s audio engine.&#xD;&#xD;Example: connect osc1 saw to filter1 audio</comment><header></header><code></code><translations></translations><inputs><input type="%s"><options>§_ext_syn_names</options></input><input type="%s"><options>§_ext_syn_outputs</options></input><input type="%s"><options>§_ext_syn_names</options></input><input type="%s"><options>§_ext_syn_inputs</options></input></inputs><script><custom-block s="load modular synth primitives"></custom-block><block s="doApplyExtension"><l>syn_connect(module, output, module, input)</l><list><block var="module"/><block var="output"/><block var="module2"/><block var="input"/></list></block></script></block-definition><block-definition s="disconnect %&apos;module&apos; %&apos;input&apos;" type="command" category="Modular"><comment x="0" y="0" w="220" collapsed="false">Unplugs every cable from an input jack of a module.</comment><header></header><code></code><translations></translations><inputs><input type="%s"><options>§_ext_syn_names</options></input><input type="%s"><options>§_ext_syn_inputs</options></input></inputs><script><custom-block s="load modular synth primitives"></custom-block><block s="doApplyExtension"><l>syn_disconnect(module, input)</l><list><block var="module"/><block var="input"/></list></block></script></block-definition><block-definition s="set %&apos;module&apos; %&apos;knob&apos; to %&apos;value&apos;" type="command" category="Modular"><comment x="0" y="0" w="240" collapsed="false">Turns a knob of a module to the given value. Values outside the knob&apos;s range are clipped.</comment><header></header><code></code><translations></translations><inputs><input type="%s"><options>§_ext_syn_names</options></input><input type="%s"><options>§_ext_syn_knobs</options></input><input type="%n"></input></inputs><script><custom-block s="load modular synth primitives"></custom-block><block s="doApplyExtension"><l>syn_set(module, knob, value)</l><list><block var="module"/><block var="knob"/><block var="value"/></list></block></script></block-definition><block-definition s="%&apos;module&apos; %&apos;knob&apos;" type="reporter" category="Modular"><comment x="0" y="0" w="200" collapsed="false">Reports the current position of a knob of a module.</comment><header></header><code></code><translations></translations><inputs><input type="%s"><options>§_ext_syn_names</options></input><input type="%s"><options>§_ext_syn_knobs</options></input></inputs><script><custom-block s="load modular synth primitives"></custom-block><block s="doReport"><block s="reportApplyExtension"><l>syn_get(module, knob)</l><list><block var="module"/><block var="knob"/></list></block></block></script></block-definition><block-definition s="gate %&apos;module&apos; %&apos;on?&apos;" type="command" category="Modular"><comment x="0" y="0" w="240" collapsed="false">Opens (true) or closes (false) the gate of an envelope module by hand, in place of a cable in its gate input. Opening the gate starts the attack, closing it starts the release.</comment><header></header><code></code><translations></translations><inputs><input type="%s"><options>§_ext_syn_names</options></input><input type="%b"></input></inputs><script><custom-block s="load modular synth primitives"></custom-block><block s="doApplyExtension"><l>syn_gate(module, bool)</l><list><block var="module"/><block var="on?"/></list></block></script></block-definition><block-definition s="modules" type="reporter" category="Modular"><comment x="0" y="0" w="200" collapsed="false">Reports the names of all existing modules.</comment><header></header><code></code><translations></translations><inputs></inputs><script><custom-block s="load modular synth primitives"></custom-block><block s="doReport"><block s="reportApplyExtension"><l>syn_modules()</l><list></list></block></block></script></block-definition><block-definition s="note %&apos;number&apos; as volts" type="reporter" category="Modular"><comment x="0" y="0" w="240" collapsed="false">Converts a MIDI note number into a pitch control voltage (1 V per octave). Middle C (60) is 0 V, which is the pitch a VCO plays with no cable in its cv1 input and range and tune set to 0.</comment><header></header><code></code><translations></translations><inputs><input type="%n">60</input></inputs><script><block s="doReport"><block s="reportQuotient"><block s="reportDifference"><block var="number"/><l>60</l></block><l>12</l></block></block></script></block-definition></blocks>
